[{"id":"privacy-notice-00","source":"privacy-notice.txt","index":0,"section":"DUCKS ON THE POND CARDS PRIVACY NOTICE","sections":["DUCKS ON THE POND CARDS PRIVACY NOTICE","1. WHO WE ARE","2. THE TEST RELEASE","3. WHAT WE COLLECT","3. WHAT WE COLLECT › 3.1 Information you enter","3. WHAT WE COLLECT › 3.2 Information collected automatically"],"words":315,"overlapWords":0,"text":"DUCKS ON THE POND CARDS PRIVACY NOTICE\n\nVersion: 1.0 DRAFT, November 2026\n\nDRAFT. This notice describes how the current test release handles data, based on how the Application is built. It has not been reviewed by a lawyer or a privacy professional and is not yet in force. Items marked [TO CONFIRM] are placeholders.\n\n1. WHO WE ARE\n\nDucks on the Pond Cards (\"we\", \"us\") runs the Ducks on the Pond Cards application (\"the Application\"). We are responsible for the personal information described in this notice.\n\nContact for privacy questions: privacy@ducksonthepondcards.com [TO CONFIRM], or the support contact in section 4 of the Customer Service Policy.\n\n2. THE TEST RELEASE\n\nThe current release uses shared test users (Alice, Bob and Carol) instead of personal accounts. It does not ask for your name, email address, password, postal address or payment details. Anything typed into the test release can be seen by anyone else using the same test user, and may be reset without notice. Please do not enter real personal details.\n\nThe rest of this notice describes what the Application stores in general, and applies in full once personal accounts are introduced.\n\n3. WHAT WE COLLECT\n\n3.1 Information you enter\n\n- Account details: your username. (Once personal accounts arrive: your email address and sign-in details. [TO CONFIRM]) - Collection: the cards you own, serial numbers, grading company, grade, cert number, price paid, date acquired, listed price, sale price and date, and condition notes. - Wishlist: the cards you want, minimum grade, maximum price, notes, and whether each want is public or private. - Trades: offers you make and receive, the cards in them, their status, and trade messages. - Serial-number reviews: your note for the admin, and the admin's decision and note. - Catalog entries you add: sets, parallels, cards and variants. - Search questions you type on the Search page. - Anything you send to support.","tokens":425,"embedding":[-0.021774234250187874,0.032758645713329315,-0.053860533982515335,0.0018825395964086056,0.05509864166378975,-0.010489970445632935,0.10108525305986404,-0.011231038719415665,0.017362596467137337,0.006212953478097916,0.011191725730895996,-0.051131006330251694,-0.004517529159784317,-0.036119621247053146,-0.017691273242235184,-0.023706017062067986,-0.020262015983462334,-0.054538365453481674,-0.0377555713057518,0.025278663262724876,-0.054286569356918335,0.03309706225991249,0.012570534832775593,0.026799742132425308,-0.06407804787158966,-0.04536164551973343,-0.04049840196967125,0.01667572185397148,-0.0900874212384224,-0.012307935394346714,0.025555532425642014,0.0770353153347969,0.1093870997428894,0.011884666047990322,0.07189490646123886,-0.05635018274188042,-0.0029243442695587873,-0.00056476891040802,0.000807126984000206,-0.05289316549897194,-0.017161482945084572,-0.12506791949272156,-0.06281887739896774,0.055006492882966995,-0.022509653121232986,0.04382750019431114,-0.020644480362534523,0.03281303495168686,-0.053532905876636505,0.07243193686008453,-0.0017773858271539211,-0.03863927721977234,-0.013422942720353603,0.04310016706585884,-0.015655776485800743,0.05106076970696449,0.010271120816469193,-0.05445823818445206,-0.05607250705361366,-0.026528891175985336,-0.003961978014558554,-0.03945948928594589,-0.024721071124076843,0.0797446146607399,-0.026322057470679283,-0.00766549538820982,-0.08143526315689087,0.0021282287780195475,0.05681995302438736,-0.07623405754566193,-0.05572120472788811,0.06319289654493332,-0.037611763924360275,-0.0382380411028862,-0.0013181702233850956,0.07213065773248672,-0.012668651528656483,